<title>USA: Global TeleMedia enters $7.5 mln agreement.</title>
<headline>Global TeleMedia enters $7.5 mln agreement.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global TeleMedia International Inc said on Wednesday that it entered into a agreement with US ONE Communications Corp with a minimum commitment of $7.5 million.</p>
<p>Under the terms, Global TeleMedia will start utilizing US ONE switches in Denver and Chicago during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
